OL,3,GNEWSAF1 Academy driver hopes to inspire
OL,4,Anext generation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19-year-old woman who went from
OL,7,Fgo-karting "as something to do at the
OL,8,Fweekend" to competing around the world
OL,9,Fis urging more girls to take up
OL,10,Fmotorsport.
OL,12,FAlisha Palmowski, from Manchester,
OL,13,Fcurrently drives in the F1 Academy, an
OL,14,Finternational racing series which helps
OL,15,Fyoung female drivers improve their
OL,16,Fskills.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
