OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAF1 Academy driver hopes to inspire
OL,4,Anext generation
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe currently races in front of
OL,7,Fmillions of people across the world but
OL,8,Fstarted go-karting at a track in
OL,9,FTrafford Park as "very much just a
OL,10,Fhobby" and now hopes she can inspire
OL,11,Fother girls to take it up.
OL,13,F"Motorsport is very much a
OL,14,Fmale-dominated sport, it always has
OL,15,Fbeen," she said, "However I do believe
OL,16,Fthat landscape is very much changing."
